4	//! This module is engine-contract-free: it owns queues of [`PendingRequest`]s
5	//! and produces pure [`effects::StepEffects`] data. The serve loop itself
6	//! belongs to the contract's driver, and everything that touches the engine
7	//! contract (typestate handles, emitter calls, the `Scheduler` trait) lives in
8	//! [`crate::frontend_adapter`] — read that file to see how Qwen3 plugs into
